#: ca3070e98d304f29ba5c4d4f097a5dcb
msgid "Jittor 2.0 Migration Notes"
msgstr "计图 2.0 迁移说明"

#: 5040fead602e4621850386aa59439842
msgid "Breaking Changes"
msgstr ""

#: dabe42f6537b4007b6907b9505dd8aec
msgid "Torch compatibility no longer replaces the Jittor package version"
msgstr "Torch 兼容层不再覆盖 Jittor 包版本"

#: b3e9e02930c441d7ad9032a182b4d277
msgid ""
"`jittor.__version__` now always reports the installed Jittor distribution"
" version (`1.3.11.0` for this release line), including when the deployed "
"Torch entry point is used and `torch is jittor`. Code that needs the "
"emulated PyTorch API level must use `jittor.__torch_version__` or "
"`torch.version.__version__`; both currently report `2.11.0`."
msgstr ""

#: 7e6fdce7aa3340fe81c18f3a023a6be3
msgid ""
"Required Torch compatibility installers always fail with a named install "
"step, even when `JITTOR_TORCH_STRICT_BOOTSTRAP` is disabled. That switch "
"controls the optional shim runtime bootstrap only; it cannot hide an "
"incomplete core API. The deployment CLI verification command reports the "
"Torch API version through `torch.__torch_version__` and "
"`torch.version.__version__`, not the Jittor backend version exposed as "
"`torch.__version__` by the same-module entry point."
msgstr ""

#: 661539633a73440e8e8a512deb4e32b7
msgid "`jittor.vcompiler` retired"
msgstr ""

#: cd223e670fae4bc495c0a6815254f685
msgid ""
"Jittor 2.0 removes the experimental `jittor.vcompiler` package and its "
"`build()` decorator. Importing that package compiled a private C++ "
"static-graph extension as a side effect, and the API had no in-repository"
" consumer or stable compatibility contract. Source checkouts and "
"installed wheels now both report no module specification for "
"`jittor.vcompiler`."
msgstr ""

#: 603d3823c4ef41da8d0dec06f88a83f9
msgid ""
"There is no drop-in replacement for its cached static-graph decorator. "
"Use normal Jittor graph execution for model code. Extension authors who "
"need a custom operation should use the maintained "
"`jittor.compile_custom_op` or `jittor.compile_custom_ops` interfaces and "
"explicitly test forward and backward behavior on each supported backend."
msgstr ""

#: 221da21ef75f4f34bdc545bfbe75ef8c
msgid "Repository-only payload moved out of the wheel"
msgstr ""

#: 909085343be2443ab8fa5e7363dc9a38
msgid ""
"Operational scripts, release utilities, examples, and notebooks now live "
"under root `tools/` and `examples/`. They remain available in the source "
"distribution but are no longer importable members of the runtime wheel. "
"Installed-environment validation uses `python -m jittor.selftest`."
msgstr ""

#: 7754273202ef4e63a33a346a62619caf
msgid ""
"MyST Markdown under `examples/notebooks/` is the canonical tutorial "
"source. Generated `.ipynb` files are no longer versioned or shipped in "
"the source distribution; `python -m nox -s tutorials` materializes them "
"in external state and runs the maintained offline CPU smoke set."
msgstr ""

#: 267e9a7de6544e72bf91f9f8394e9ea3
msgid ""
"The legacy Clang pass under `jittor/extern/llvm` and the callable "
"`jittor.compiler.compile_extern()` are not removed in this release stage."
" Their retirement is deferred until the Linux/Clang cold-compilation gate"
" passes."
msgstr ""
